associate the top level environment with a top-level procedure
at a time earlier than invocation time in 1APPLY*.
We also note that 1LOOKUP1* will have its hands on the top-level
environment anyway just before it locates the definition of a top-level
procedure.  Exploiting this idea yields an alternate solution.  {Note 1LABELS*}
