0
	Each call to 1RGEN* delivers as its value a new pseudo-random
number generator which is an instance of the prototype described by the 
1LAMBDA*-expression which is the body of 1RGEN*.  Each one has a
state variable which is its seed.  The state of each instance is distinct
from that of every other instance.  This gives one the power of the own
variables of ALGOL 60 without any additional mechanism.

